OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANot 'poor enough': Do people use
OL,4,ALondon's pay-it-forward schemes?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaybe you've come across a sign like
OL,7,Fthis before. It reads: "If you need a
OL,8,Flittle something, but circumstances are
OL,9,Fchallenging for whatever reason, take a
OL,10,Fheart and hand it to us at the counter,
OL,11,Fno explanation needed."
OL,13,FThese are known as pay-it-forward
OL,14,Fschemes. It's when people can donate
OL,15,Finto a pot of money that can be claimed
OL,16,Fby others to cover the cost of things
OL,17,Flike a coffee or a book.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
