OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANot 'poor enough': Do people use
OL,4,ALondon's pay-it-forward schemes?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmid the rising cost of living, schemes
OL,7,Flike these have the potential to offset
OL,8,Fthe burden of small costs that can feel
OL,9,Fincreasingly expensive. But how often
OL,10,Fdo they get used? And do people feel
OL,11,Fcomfortable using them?
OL,13,FHost Cafe, in the heart of the City of
OL,14,FLondon, is home to one of these
OL,15,Fschemes.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
